# Build context for infrastructure/docker/Dockerfile.*. Secrets never enter an image:
# every .env file is excluded except the committed dev placeholders.
# Patterns use **/ so they match in every directory, not only at the root (Next's
# standalone output would otherwise copy apps/web/.env* into the image).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/id_rsa*

.git
.github
.superpowers
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
packages/database/src/generated
packages/ui/showcase/dist
apps/web/next-env.d.ts
test-results
playwright-report
e2e/.auth
.DS_Store
docs
**/.cache
